# Tutorial: {{REPO}} in TypeScript

The TypeScript port of [the Python tutorial](../../python3/tutorials/README.md), with the same case studies and the
same step anchors, `<a id="Tnn.k"></a>`, in the same order.

## Running the notebooks

```sh
cd typescript5
npm install
npx tsx tests/run-notebooks.ts tutorials/*.ipynb   # runs them as tests; npm test runs them with the tests
```

